              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\" 'Munkolere ekyoto eky'ettaka, muweereyo okwo ssaddaaka zammwe ezookebwa, n'essaddaaka olw'emirembe, ey'endiga zo n'ente zo. Mu buli kifo mwe nnaaleeteranga erinnya lyange okuweebwa ekitiibwa, nnajjanga ne mbaweera omwo omukisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
